{
  "$schema": "../theme.schema.json",
  "name": "Steampunk",
  "description": "An airship and clockwork counting house: cog-wrights, a pneumatic post, gaslight and brass, mahogany and baize.",
  "company": "Thistlewaite & Co.",
  "branch": "Mooring Mast",
  "titles": {
    "manager": "Senior Partner",
    "receptionist": "Front Parlour Clerk",
    "cleaner": "Brass Polisher",
    "temp": "Junior Copyist",
    "vendor": "Muffin Trolley",
    "itSupport": "Difference Engineer"
  },
  "manager": {
    "name": "Ambrose Tillingham",
    "look": {
      "head": "boss",
      "skin": "rosy",
      "build": "big",
      "outfit": "suit",
      "hair": "#c4bcae",
      "hairHighlight": "#e2dccf",
      "facialHair": "#c4bcae",
      "eye": "#3a2a20",
      "shirt": "#f2e8d0",
      "outer": "#2a2230",
      "tie": "#7a1f2b",
      "collar": "#fbf5e6",
      "accent": "#c9a043",
      "pants": "#2a2230",
      "shoes": "#1c1410",
      "glasses": "#d4a83a",
      "belt": false
    },
    "lines": [
      "Splendid work. Now polish it until it gleams like the banister.",
      "The pressure gauge says 'nominal'. I prefer the word 'ambitious'.",
      "My study door is always open. Do knock on the brass bit, though.",
      "Let us not call it a delay. Let us call it a scenic holding pattern.",
      "Monocle adjusted. You may proceed with the quarterly figures.",
      "Tea is at four, precisely. Strategy is whenever the tea runs out."
    ]
  },
  "receptionist": {
    "name": "Clementine Ashby",
    "look": {
      "head": "receptionist",
      "skin": "warm",
      "build": "normal",
      "outfit": "blouse",
      "hair": "#3b2216",
      "hairHighlight": "#5e3a26",
      "eye": "#2f4a3a",
      "shirt": "#f3ead6",
      "collar": "#fffaf0",
      "accent": "#7a1f2b",
      "accent2": "#c9a043",
      "bow": "#7a1f2b",
      "skirt": true,
      "legs": "#3a2a24",
      "shoes": "#2a1a14"
    },
    "lines": [
      "Good morning, Thistlewaite & Co. Your enquiry is in the tube.",
      "Do take a seat. The settee only hisses when someone sits on it.",
      "Parcel's gone up the pneumatic post. It may come down eventually.",
      "The 11:40 to Upper Mooring is eleven minutes fashionable.",
      "Kindly sign the visitors' book. The pen is chained for its own safety."
    ]
  },
