  "smallTalk": [
    [
      "Is the boiler meant to whistle in that key?",
      "Only on Tuesdays. Today it appears to be improvising."
    ],
    [
      "Have you seen the automaton intern filing?",
      "Alphabetically, then by weight. Terribly thorough."
    ],
    [
      "Did the two-fifteen airship leave on time?",
      "The airship did. The timetable left at half past."
    ],
    [
      "Who wound the office clock backwards?",
      "Nobody will admit it, but the cuckoo looks shifty."
    ],
    [
      "Is it four o'clock yet?",
      "Three fifty-eight. Hold your saucer steady."
    ],
    [
      "The pneumatic post delivered me a sandwich again.",
      "I got a memo about ham. I think we swapped lunches."
    ],
    [
      "Who left a compass in the biscuit tin?",
      "It points to the custard creams. Very reliable instrument."
    ],
    [
      "Is the brass polished for the inspection?",
      "I can see my own reflection frowning in it, so yes."
    ]
  ],
  "staff": [
    {
      "name": "Ottilie Brackenbury",
      "role": "Chief Cog-Wright",
      "look": {
        "head": "ponytail",
        "skin": "fair",
        "build": "tall",
        "outfit": "vest",
        "hair": "#8e3c1c",
        "hairHighlight": "#b45a30",
        "eye": "#3a5a40",
        "shirt": "#f0e6cf",
        "outer": "#6e2430",
        "accent": "#c9a043",
        "pants": "#3a2c24",
        "shoes": "#22160f",
        "glasses": "#d4a83a",
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#5a3a1e"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Every cog has a purpose. Except that one. Nobody talks about that one.",
        "If it ticks, it is working. If it tocks, come and fetch me.",
        "I oiled the director's door. He is unsettled by the quiet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Barnaby Okafor",
      "role": "Pneumatic-Post Clerk",
      "look": {
        "head": "prankster",
        "skin": "deep",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "shirtTie",
        "hair": "#16110e",
        "eye": "#2a1a12",
        "shirt": "#f4ecd8",
        "tie": "#2e5a3c",
        "collar": "#fffaf0",
        "pants": "#4a3a2e",
        "shoes": "#1c1410",
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#c9a043"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Your memo is in the tube. Stand well back from the whoosh.",
        "The second floor wants a canister of paperclips. At speed, naturally.",
        "I posted myself a letter to test the line. Lovely to hear from me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hortense Achterberg",
      "role": "Chronometer Keeper",
      "look": {
        "head": "bob",
        "skin": "rosy",
        "build": "small",
        "outfit": "buttonCardigan",
        "hair": "#2a1c18",
        "eye": "#4a3a2a",
        "shirt": "#efe2c8",
        "outer": "#2e5a3c",
        "collar": "#fbf5e6",
        "accent": "#c9a043",
        "skirt": true,
        "legs": "#2a2026",
        "shoes": "#1c1410",
        "glasses": "#c9a043"
      },
      "lines": [
        "It is fourteen minutes and nine seconds past ten. You are welcome.",
        "I keep forty clocks. They agree on nothing, like a proper committee.",
        "Punctuality is a virtue. Arriving early is simply showing off."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rajan Mistry",
      "role": "Ledger Clerk, Triplicate Division",
      "look": {
        "head": "crossword",
        "skin": "brown",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "vest",
        "hair": "#1e1612",
        "hairHighlight": "#3a2c22",
        "facialHair": "#1e1612",
        "eye": "#2a1a12",
        "shirt": "#f2e8d0",
        "outer": "#c99e44",
        "sleeve": "#f2e8d0",
        "tie": "#6e2234",
        "pants": "#3a3036",
        "shoes": "#1c1410",
        "glasses": "#d4a83a"
      },
      "lines": [
        "One copy for the files, one for the archive, one for the other archive.",
        "I have balanced the ledger. Kindly do not breathe on it.",
        "Carbon paper is the nearest thing I have to a hobby."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tobias Greenhalgh",
      "role": "Boiler Warden",
      "look": {
        "head": "spiky",
        "skin": "olive",
        "build": "big",
        "outfit": "plain",
        "hair": "#4a3426",
        "facialHair": "#4a3426",
        "eye": "#2a3a2a",
        "shirt": "#3f4a52",
        "pants": "#2c2622",
        "shoes": "#14100c",
        "glasses": "#b8862e",
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#7a4a22"
      },
      "lines": [
        "The needle's in the green. The green is smaller than it was.",
        "One long whistle means walk calmly. Two means walk rather briskly.",
        "Do not lean on the valve. The valve has a temper."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Adaeze Fairbrother",
      "role": "Aeronaut, First Class",
      "look": {
        "head": "curly",
        "skin": "deep",
        "build": "tall",
        "outfit": "suit",
        "hair": "#120d0b",
        "eye": "#2a1a12",
        "shirt": "#f3ead6",
        "outer": "#7a4a26",
        "tie": "#c9a043",
        "accent": "#c9a043",
        "pants": "#e6d8b8",
        "shoes": "#3a2216",
        "glasses": "#d4a83a",
        "belt": true,
        "beltColor": "#3a2216"
      },
      "lines": [
        "Cloud at four hundred feet, tea at four o'clock. Both non-negotiable.",
        "Sixty hours aloft this month, and three in the expenses queue.",
        "A good landing is any landing you walk away from with your hat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Percival Lund",
      "role": "Tea-Urn Engineer",
      "look": {
        "head": "knitting",
        "skin": "fair",
        "build": "small",
        "outfit": "cardigan",
        "hair": "#d8d2c4",
        "hairHighlight": "#f0ebe0",
        "facialHair": "#d8d2c4",
        "eye": "#3a4a5a",
        "shirt": "#efe2c8",
        "outer": "#8a3a2e",
        "pants": "#4a4038",
        "shoes": "#22160f",
        "glasses": "#a8743c"
      },
      "lines": [
        "The urn is at full pressure. Approach with a saucer and respect.",
        "Milk in first is a matter for the disciplinary committee.",
        "I have tuned the kettle to a gentle sigh. Any louder means biscuits."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mei-Ling Cartwright",
      "role": "Keeper of the Airship Timetable",
      "look": {
        "head": "hr",
        "skin": "warm",
        "build": "normal",
        "outfit": "openCardigan",
        "hair": "#1a1414",
        "hairHighlight": "#3a2c2c",
        "eye": "#2a1a12",
        "shirt": "#f3ead6",
        "outer": "#3a3a5a",
        "sleeve": "#3a3a5a",
        "collar": "#fffaf0",
        "accent": "#c9a043",
        "skirt": true,
        "legs": "#2a2026",
        "shoes": "#1c1410",
        "bow": "#c9a043"
      },
      "lines": [
        "The nine-oh-five is late: wind, ballast and an important pigeon.",
        "Every timetable is a work of fiction. Mine is merely well bound.",
        "Platform three is the mast with the flag. The other flag is laundry."
      ]
    }
